---
---
<section style="position: relative; padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
  <div class="b-container b-hero-grid">
    <div style="max-width: 720px;">
      <h1 class="t-display" style="margin-bottom: 24px; text-wrap: balance;">LLM이 만든<br>그럴듯한 초고 위에,<br><span class="b-hand-underline" style="font-family: var(--b-font-hand-gaegu), var(--b-font-hand-nps), cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.4em;">감성 한 스푼.</span></h1>
      <p class="t-body" style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 36px; color: var(--b-ink-soft);">혼자 개발이 가능해진 시대,<br>각자의 전문성을 더한 작은 프로젝트 팀을 만들어 드려요.</p>
      <div class="b-cta-row">
        <a href="#apply" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 14px 24px; background: var(--b-olive); color: var(--b-on-olive); border-radius: 14px; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: rgba(80, 65, 40, 0.08) 0px 1px 0px, rgba(93, 107, 44, 0.25) 0px 6px 16px; transition: 200ms;">객원 멤버 신청하기<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href="/progress" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 13px 22px; background: transparent; color: var(--b-olive-deep); border: 1.5px solid var(--b-olive); border-radius: 14px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; transition: 200ms;">진행상황 먼저 둘러보기<span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0.7;">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="b-hero-cluster">
      <div style="background: var(--b-note-yellow); padding: 16px 18px 18px; transform: rotate(-4deg); box-shadow: var(--b-shadow-note); font-family: var(--b-font-hand); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--b-ink); border-radius: 2px; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 20px; width: 200px;">"그럴듯한 초고 위에<br>사람 한 스푼."<br><span style="font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.7;">— intent v0</span></div>
      <div style="background: var(--b-note-mint); padding: 16px 18px 18px; transform: rotate(5deg); box-shadow: var(--b-shadow-note); font-family: var(--b-font-sans); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--b-ink); border-radius: 2px; position: absolute; top: 130px; left: 70px; width: 180px; font-weight: 500;">
        <div style="font-family: var(--b-font-hand); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px;">3개월, 6회차</div>
        <div>학습자료 → 멤버 출시 → 다음 멤버</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--b-note-pink); padding: 16px 18px 18px; transform: rotate(-3deg); box-shadow: var(--b-shadow-note); font-family: var(--b-font-hand); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--b-ink); border-radius: 2px; position: absolute; top: 230px; left: 0px; width: 160px;">객원 멤버도 환영<br>(그냥 와도 OK)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
